  "system_prompt": "You are a senior medicinal chemist specializing in prodrug design and ADMET optimization. Always respond with valid JSON containing a 'modifications' list. Each modification must include 'description', 'smiles', and 'rationale' fields.",
  "user_prompt": "As a medicinal chemist, optimize Remdesivir (SMILES: CCC(CC)COC(=O)[C@@H](N[P@@](=O)(OCC1C(O)C(O)C(n2cnc3c(N)ncnc23)O1)Oc1ccccc1)C) as a prodrug for enhanced bioavailability and target-specific activation against SARS-CoV-2 RdRp. Suggest SMILES modifications that improve ADMET while maintaining or enhancing activity.\n\nRespond ONLY with JSON in this exact format:\n{\"modifications\": [{\"description\": \"modification description\", \"smiles\": \"MODIFIED_SMILES_STRING\", \"rationale\": \"scientific rationale\"}]}",
  "raw_response": "```json\n{\n  \"modifications\": [\n    {\n      \"description\": \"Introduce a hydrophilic phosphate prodrug moiety to improve solubility and facilitate activation by cellular phosphatases.\",\n      \"smiles\": \"CCC(CC)COC(=O)[C@@H](N[P@@](=O)(OP(=O)(O)OCC1C(O)C(O)C(n2cnc3c(N)ncnc23)O1)Oc1ccccc1)C\",\n      \"rationale\": \"The addition of a phosphate group increases the compound's hydrophilicity and allows for enzymatic cleavage by cellular phosphatases, enhancing bioavailability and activation at the target site.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"description\": \"Replace the phenyl moiety with a p-methoxyphenyl group to improve metabolic stability and reduce off-target interactions.\",\n      \"smiles\": \"CCC(CC)COC(=O)[C@@H](N[P@@](=O)(OCC1C(O)C(O)C(n2cnc3c(N)ncnc23)O1)Oc1ccc(OC)cc1)C\",\n      \"rationale\": \"The p-methoxyphenyl modification can reduce non-specific binding and improve the metabolic stability of the prodrug by decreasing susceptibility to oxidative metabolism.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"description\": \"Incorporate an ethylene glycol linker on the nucleoside sugar hydroxyl to enhance membrane permeability.\",\n      \"smiles\": \"CCC(CC)COC(=O)[C@@H](N[P@@](=O)(OCC1C(OCCO)C(O)C(n2cnc3c(N)ncnc23)O1)Oc1ccccc1)C\",\n      \"rationale\": \"The ethylene glycol linker can enhance the compound's lipophilicity and membrane permeability, improving absorption and delivery to intracellular targets.\"\n    }\n  ]\n}\n```",
